  "titulo": "Conjugate estar in the present subjunctive",
  "subtitulo": "Esté, estés, estemos: regular, but with accents in the right places.",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "Estar has a regular stem and endings in the present subjunctive, with a written accent on the last syllable except estemos: esté, estés, esté, estemos, estén.",
